      "sourceUrl": "https://bwaquatics.com/products/wild-betta-miniopinna",
      "html": "<ul><li>From the Betta coccina complex.</li><li>IUCN Red List: Critically Endangered (CR).</li><li>Maximum size: 1.2–1.5 inches (about 3–3.8 cm).</li><li>Breeding: bubblenester.</li></ul>"
    },
    {
      "key": "beforeYouBuy",
      "source": "bwaquatics",
      "sourceUrl": "https://bwaquatics.com/products/wild-betta-miniopinna",
      "html": "<p>Wild caught Betta miniopinna from Indonesia (no specific location at this time). They are quite similar to Persephone but show more red on the ventral fins. Be sure to have the habitat ready before purchase.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "distribution",
      "source": "bwaquatics",
