      "html": "<p>Indonesia.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "waterConditions",
      "source": "bwaquatics",
      "sourceUrl": "https://bwaquatics.com/products/wild-betta-miniopinna",
      "html": "<ul><li>TDS: 60–100</li><li>pH: 5.0–6.5</li><li>Temperature: 75–82°F (24–28°C)</li></ul>"
    },
    {
      "key": "diet",
      "source": "bwaquatics",
      "sourceUrl": "https://bwaquatics.com/products/wild-betta-miniopinna",
      "html": "<p>Carnivorous. The seller currently feeds live blackworms, frozen bloodworms and pellets.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "behaviour",
      "source": "bwaquatics",
      "sourceUrl": "https://bwaquatics.com/products/wild-betta-miniopinna",
      "html": "<p>Moderately aggressive; males can be territorial when establishing breeding grounds. However, because of their small size, multiple pairs can be kept as long as there is enough space. Recommended: 1 pair per 5 gallons (about 19 litres).</p>"
    },
    {
